# <<< loom-managed <<<

# Sibling copies of Loom's token pool (e.g. `.loom/tokens.shadow-disabled-<ts>/`,
# hand backups). Loom's managed block above ignores only the exact `.loom/tokens/`,
# and a sibling copy of it is how 21 live OAuth tokens reached public
# rjwalters/loom main (a9da48c2). Loom #9046 adds these rules to the managed block
# on the next re-init; they live out here until then, so no Loom resync commit can
# sweep a pool copy into this public repo.
.loom/tokens.*/
.loom/tokens-*/


# Repo Skills machine-local install metadata (absolute source path + timestamp)
.claude/skills/repo/.install-local.json
